class_name Cutscene
extends Dialogue
## A Stardew Valley style event: a list of commands acted out in the world
## (camera, characters walking, emotes, dialogue with choices...). Same
## conditions as Dialogue (min_day, requires_flag, once, sets_flag,
## priority); `script_text` holds the commands, one per line — see
## CutsceneScript for the command list. One .tres per event in
## res://data/cutscenes/.
